{"unit_id":"00080000__dsh-project-memory#card-zh","repo":"00080000/dsh-project-memory","commit":"3ee4b007deb516224d9d22ee0c35ed2252541161","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Project Memory（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为项目开发提供跨会话的持久记忆。它接入 DSH 工具、任务命令、后台索引监视和 Web 任务面板，将项目文档切块、代码符号、经验记录与任务状态保存在项目目录，并通过混合检索返回带路径和行号的引用。主要功能包括索引 PDF、Markdown 和文本文件，索引代码仓库，按问题查询记忆，保存或删除经验条目，以及续接和归档跨会话任务。适合需要在会话切换或上下文压缩后继续开发、查找项目资料的 DSH 用户。默认把数据存入项目内的 .dsh-project-memory；无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:163-245","src/tools/query-memory.js:59-128","src/setup/taskbridge.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"00080000__dsh-project-memory#card-en","repo":"00080000/dsh-project-memory","commit":"3ee4b007deb516224d9d22ee0c35ed2252541161","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Project Memory is a Web plugin for persistent project context. Its tools index documents and code, search with file citations, save experience notes, and manage tasks across sessions. A watcher can refresh indexes. Data stays in the project memory directory; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:163-245","src/tools/query-memory.js:59-128","src/setup/taskbridge.js:1"]}
